@file topics.h
@brief Project-specific Doxygen group definitions.

@details
This file defines the documentation groups (topics) for the
µOS++ Tracing Infrastructure. Although it uses a `.h` extension,
it is not part of the build; it is processed exclusively by Doxygen.
The `.h` extension is required because Doxygen does not process
arbitrary file extensions in the same way as recognised header files.

This file is located in `website/doxygen/` and is referenced via
`@include{doc}` from `topics.h`.
